IBM Plex Mono (SIL Open Font License 1.1), latin subset, weights 400/500/600.
Fetch with:

  for w in 400 500 600; do curl -fLo fonts/plex-mono-$w.woff2 https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/ibm-plex-mono@latest/latin-$w-normal.woff2; done
  curl -fLo fonts/OFL.txt https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IBM/plex/master/LICENSE.txt
